# Anchored to repo root (leading slash): these are Python packaging
# build-artifact directory names, not meant to match same-named
# directories anywhere in the tree — an unanchored `lib/` here
# previously matched frontend/src/lib/ and three feature-level lib/
# dirs, silently excluding all of them (17 real source files) from
# version control.
